In _Edge of Eternities_, you'll take your first steps into the cosmic wonders of the Sothera system, where the infinite possibilities of space unfurl before you. Here, you'll meet familiar and strange faces, battle alongside interstellar factions, and discover what lies at the heart of Sothera, the supervoid.

We recently showed a glimpse of _Edge of Eternities_, and you can fully immerse yourself in the story right now! Read "Episode 1" and the rest of the _Edge of Eternities_ stories on MTGStory.com or listen to _The Magic Story Podcast_, where we'll be releasing audio narrations of this far-out fiction. To prepare for your trip, you can read this Planeswalker's Guide to _Edge of Eternities_ to learn everything there is to know about the Edge.

Ready to take to the stars? _Edge of Eternities _releases worldwide on August 1, 2025, and the _Magic _Multiverse will never be the same. You can preorder the set now from your local game store, online retailers like Amazon, and elsewhere _Magic _products are sold.

